# Cluster Grouper local settings. Defaults work without this file.
# Export desired values in your terminal before `make run`.
# Use absolute paths for overrides. Relative overrides depend on the process
# working directory. Defaults resolve from the backend package location.
# CLUSTER_DATA_DIR=/absolute/private/path/cluster-grouper-state
# CLUSTER_MODEL_DIR=/absolute/path/cluster-grouper-models
# CLUSTER_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000

# Never save a Footage Review token, Authorization header, or real biometric
# fixture in this file. Enter the active token only in the masked app form.
# Data/model directories and local .env files must stay out of version control.
